{"id":"514ed893e8fcac45","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-thm-morse-inequalities.md","title":"Morse Inequalities","display":"thm-morse-inequalities — Morse Inequalities","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-morse-inequalities","aliases":["58-thm-morse-inequalities"],"display":"thm-morse-inequalities — Morse Inequalities","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-morse-inequalities"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-morse-inequalities</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-morse-inequalities — Morse Inequalities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62ba03663f91241e\" href=\"?note=62ba03663f91241e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md\">../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4cdc6123abf4dd8\" href=\"?note=e4cdc6123abf4dd8\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md\">../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"025c5240f130d970\" href=\"?note=025c5240f130d970\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md\">../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"06b5f03f1e28a63b\" href=\"?note=06b5f03f1e28a63b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-top5-compact-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,n\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,n\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=|\\{p\\in M:\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(k,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}|\">\\(c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=|\\{p\\in M:\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(k,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}|\\)</span> is the metatheoretic critical-point count</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_M(k)=\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}H_k(M;\\mathbb Q)\">\\(b_M(k)=\\dim_{\\mathbb Q}H_k(M;\\mathbb Q)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(M)\">\\(\\chi(M)\\)</span> are the metatheoretic rational Betti number and Euler characteristic, compatible with the explicit chain-complex coding in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"025c5240f130d970\" href=\"?note=025c5240f130d970\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md\">../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> marks claims using the atlas-relative differential and homology constructions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}critical\\text{-}count}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\\left(\nc_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=\n\\left|\\{p\\in M:\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(k,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}\\right|\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}critical\\text{-}count}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\forall k\\in n+1\\;\\left(\nc_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=\n\\left|\\{p\\in M:\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(k,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\}\\right|\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morse\\text{-}inequalities}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\forall q\\in n+1\\;\\left(\n\\sum_{k=0}^{q}(-1)^{q-k}c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\n\\ge\\sum_{k=0}^{q}(-1)^{q-k}b_M(k)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morse\\text{-}inequalities}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\forall q\\in n+1\\;\\left(\n\\sum_{k=0}^{q}(-1)^{q-k}c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\n\\ge\\sum_{k=0}^{q}(-1)^{q-k}b_M(k)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morse\\text{-}euler}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\sum_{k=0}^{n}(-1)^kc_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}(-1)^kb_M(k)=\\chi(M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}morse\\text{-}euler}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5CompactSpace}_S(M,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\\sum_{k=0}^{n}(-1)^kc_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\n=\\sum_{k=0}^{n}(-1)^kb_M(k)=\\chi(M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Taking successive differences yields the weak inequalities <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_M(k)\\le c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\">\\(b_M(k)\\le c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A Morse function is perfect over the chosen coefficient field when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=b_M(k)\">\\(c_{f,\\mathcal A}(k)=b_M(k)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The theorem now uses the five-place atlas-relative Morse predicate and seven-place index predicate actually supplied upstream.  Differential and homology invariants that lack a complete object-language bridge are explicitly metatheoretic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"62ba03663f91241e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-morse-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"e4cdc6123abf4dd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-betti-numbers.md","status":"resolved","id"